  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to BIRN Albania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to BIRN Albania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Albanian society upholds democratic values allowing citizens equal opportunities to make informed choices and hold public institutions accountable.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Den f&#xF6;reslagna insatsen inneb&#xE4;r ett st&#xF6;d till BIRN Albania f&#xF6;r implementering av deras halvtidsstrategi f&#xF6;r 2018-2020. BIRN Albaniens huvuduppdrag &#xE4;r att uppr&#xE4;tth&#xE5;lla demokratiska v&#xE4;rderingar, vilket till&#xE5;ter albanska medborgare att erh&#xE5;lla lika m&#xF6;jligheter till medvetna val och lika m&#xF6;jligheter att st&#xE4;lla regeringen till svars.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is core support to BIRN Albania for implementing the mid-term strategy 2018-2020. The main objective of BIRN&apos;s work in Albania is &quot;Albanian society uphold democratic values allowing citiznes equal opportunities to make informed choices and hold the goverment accountable&quot;.</narrative>
  </description>
